msgid "Double Youpï Refined Admin Dashboard"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-admin-dashboard.php
msgid "https://doubleyoupi.com/plugins/refined-admin-dashboard"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: doubleyoupi-refined-admin-dashboard.php
msgid ""
"A dark and light redesign of the whole WordPress admin: a navigation rail "
"you can reorganise, reimagined list tables and post editor, one place for "
"every notice, a dashboard you compose, a media library with folders and "
"collections, and a built-in toolkit. Native components only."
msgstr ""
"Un rediseño claro y oscuro de toda la administración de WordPress: una barra "
"de navegación que puedes reorganizar, listas y editor de entradas "
"repensados, un único lugar para todos los avisos, un escritorio que compones "
"tú, una biblioteca de medios con carpetas y colecciones, y una caja de "
"herramientas integrada. Solo componentes nativos."

